# Fagotto II, -1 octave, baseline targets. Pass 4: 1/4 runs thinned to 1/2 notes on the half-beat grid (the first note of each pair sustained); targets under 50 Hz moved up an octave (the valve did not hold them); tensions corrected by pass 2's measured error on notes of 130 Hz and up; beans*2 at the pre-silence and at beats 16, 32, 48; digest on.
# Retune (fart_v1), second pass: tensions from the per-anatomy probe, shifted by the measured in-phrase bias of the previous render (per voice and register); notes that failed to swing at push 0.7 or 0.76 play at push 0.8.
